<title>USA: Mercury Asset cuts Pioneer stake.</title>
<headline>Mercury Asset cuts Pioneer stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A unit of London-based Mercury Asset Management Group Plc said Thursday it cut its stake in Pioneer Group Inc to 1,284,390 common shares, or about 5.15 percent of the total outstanding shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Mercury said it sold 330,000 shares between November 22 and January 15 at prices ranging from $23.1667 to $24.9107.</p>
